WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
You can help Cannabis grow in several ways, from reviewing code

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:07.600
and sharing original artwork to asking questions that improve the project.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.066
The official website and GitHub repository are good places to start.

00:00:12.066 --> 00:00:16.053
There, you can read the published rules, follow release updates and

00:00:16.053 --> 00:00:17.140
join the discussion.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.779
When enrollment opens, follow the verified instructions and use your own

00:00:21.779 --> 00:00:25.797
wallet, keeping your recovery secrets private. For now, you can explore

00:00:25.797 --> 00:00:28.720
the project and find a way to contribute.
